DOCUMENT SUMMARY & OFFICIAL INSTRUCTIONS:
Official 10-item submission checklist for submitting ethical review dossiers through the UNCST NRIMS portal.

1. MUBSREC SUBMISSION PLATFORM:
All applications must be submitted via the UNCST NRIMS website: https://nrims.uncst.go.ug/

2. REQUIRED CHECKLIST:
• Full proposal (approved by supervisors and submitted to Graduate School)
• CV of investigator/s
• Community engagement plan
• Risk management plan
• Dissemination plan
• Data collection tools (translated where applicable)
• Informed consent form (translated where applicable)
• Letter from FGSR for students (or request letter for independent researchers)
• Work plan
• Proof of payment receipt from MUBS accounts office

3. BANKING DETAILS (ABSA BANK):
• USD Account: MAKERERE UNIVERSITY BUSINESS SCHOOL, ABSA Bank, A/C: 0344025878, Swift: BARCUGKX
• UGX Account: MUBS LEADERSHIP CENTER, ABSA Bank, A/C: 6003524750

